    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kachipompelu chakuEfwesesa musonekeli neyi: Nahoshi yumiyi, yowu wakwata tutumbwa tutanu natuyedi muchikasa chindi chachidiilu, wendaŋa mukachi kamanoŋu awuru atanu nayedi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nindi, Neluki nyidimu yeyi, nichiwakabakanaŋa, nichiwatatakenaŋa, nichiwabulaŋa kusha antu atama kumuchima, nichiwesekeli antu aditenaŋa nawu tuyapostolu, komana hiyapostoluku, wunayishinshiki neyi hiyantwambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wunatatakeni, wunakooli ijina dami, hiwunazeyuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, nakumoni namuloŋa, nami wunaleki kukeŋa kweyi kwatachi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi anukaku chiwadiŋi, wubalumuki mumuchima, wili nyidimu yiwelilaŋa hatachi. Neyi nehi, neyi wukubula kubalumuka mumuchima, nukwinza kudeyi nakufumisha inoŋu deyi hididi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa chuma chiwudi nachu, chiwahelaŋa nyidimu yawaNikolayitani yinahelaŋa ninami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu wukweti matu atiyi mwakuhoshayi Spiritu nayipompelu. Yowu wukwimika mushindu nakamwiteja kudya kumutondu wawumi wekala muparadisa yaNzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kachipompelu chakuSimirina musonekeli neyi. Nahoshi yumiyi, yowu Tachi, yowu Nkumininaku, wafwili wahandili cheŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Neluki yihuŋu yeyi niwuzweŋi weyi, kutoŋa waheta, neluki nimatuka anowu elaŋa nawu tudi aYudeya, komana hiyaYudeyaku, hishikola yaSatana kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi wutiyaloŋa woma wayuma yiwukukeŋa kukaba nachuku. Tiya, diyabolu keŋa ashi akwenu amakwawu mukaleya, kulonda ayeseki; mwakamona yihuŋu mafuku ikumi. Ikalaku washinshika ndo nikukufwa, nakakwinka chibaaba chawumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu wukweti matulo atiyi mwakuhoshayi Spiritu nayipompelu. Yowu wukwimika mushindu hiyakamukatisha nakufwa kwamu chiye duku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kachipompelu chakuPeriŋamu musonekeli neyi: Nahoshi yumiyi, yowu wukweti mpoku yakabali yatwa yikweti wumwemukuyedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Neluki kuwashakama, kwokwekala itanda daSatana dawanta; eyi wakakela ijina dami mbe, kudikala kukuhwelela kuwankuhwelela nehi, hela mumafuku adiŋiyi chinsahu chami Antipasi, muntu wami washinshika, ajahiluwu mukachi kenu kwashakamayi Satana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, kudi yuma yantesha yinakumoni nachu namuloŋa, muloŋa wudi nawakwenu acheŋi kwenoku etejaŋa maana ayilejeluwu kudi Balami, walejeli Balaki mwakutila anyana kaIsarela muhetu akadyi yuma yanapeshuwu nachu akishi, akeli niwuvumbi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wudi nawakwenu acheŋi nawa etejaŋa kuleja kwawaNikolayitani chochimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi balumukaku mumuchima. Neyi nehi, nukwinza swayi kudeyi, nakaasi nawu njita nampoku yakabali yamukanwa kami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu wukweti matu atiyi mwakuhoshayi Spiritu nayipompelu. Yowu wukwimika mushindu nakamwinkahu manina adiŋi akusweka, nakamwinka niilola ditooka, helolodu asonekahu ijina dadiha, dabula kwilukawu antu, chiŋa yowu muntu wukuditambula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu kachipompelu chakuTiyatira musonekeli neyi: Nahoshi yumiyi, yowu Mwana kaNzambi, wukweti mesu adi neyimuzuzu wakesi, ninyendu yidi neyi wuneŋu wakekema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nindi, Neluki nyidimu yeyi, nikukeŋa kweyi, nikukuhwelela kweyi, nikukalakala kweyi, nikutatakena kweyi, neluki nami nyidimu yeyi yakukuminina yinabadiki yakusambila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, nakumoni nami wudi namuloŋa, wunamwiteji owu mumbanda Yezebeli, waditenaŋa nindi nikaprofwetu, hakuleja nakulumbula ambuŋami akoŋi wuvumbi, adiyi niyuma yanapeshuwu nachu akishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Namushili mpinji yakubalumuka mumuchima, komana yena kwonti kwindi kubalumuka nakuleka wuvumbi windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiya, hinukumunatila hakadidi kakukata, ni akwawu elaŋa nindi wuvumbi nukuyumbila nawa muyihuŋu yasweja, chiŋa abalumuka mumuchima, aleka nyidimu yawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakajaha anyanindi nakufwa kwachipupu; niyipompelu yejima yakeluka nawu natalatalaŋa munyichima mwivumu; nakayinka wejima wenu hamuntu hamuntu mwesekela nyidimu yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa enu yenu munashali muTiyatira, yenu ejima munabuli kwiteja maanawa, munabuli kwiluka yuma yaSatana yakunama, mwahoshaŋawu; nukuyila nami hinukuyitwika chiteli chacheŋuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela chochu, kakelenu chuma chimudi nachu nichinakenza, mbe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yowu wukwimika mushindu, wukukakela nyidimu yami ndo nikunsa, nakamwinka wanta wanyuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakayiyula nambwechi yachikuŋu, neyi chafumpaŋawu manuŋu akaŋemi, pwo-pwo kwayizanda hohu; mwomunatambuli ninami nawa kudi Tata yami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakamwinka Ntanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
